  "source_concerns": [
    "Phase1 tells operator to restart both Go and PG before Phase2, so no read between separate restart events; Phase4 immediately reads recovery and Go-stopped cases after printed prompts without durable pause/confirmation",
    "Existing envelope refusal only after dispatch; no before-attempt intent journal/phase order gate; crash/re-run may replay mutation including unknown X",
    "Preflight refuses existing approved container for current runId even on resume; cannot run after correctly provisioned ENV if Docker accessible",
    "PID ownership only broad next|node|harness regex; provenance file written but not consulted; timeout deletes activePid before observed exit; process.exit paths bypass finally",
    "R2 claims36logical/procedurecompletion but only23HTTPlogicalcases scripted; no durable assertion/procedure acceptance inventory"
  ]
